#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:5
#: fad9ad24ca0f4c739c2a84fbad53cc97
msgid "Loading a bootloader with DFU"
msgstr "通过 DFU 加载引导加载程序"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:7
#: 373e435ed1c4488e8872475e80da982a
msgid ""
"This page describes how to load a new bootloader onto a STM32 based board "
"(such as a Pixhawk1) via DFU. This is useful if you are either trying to "
"bring up a new board or if you have a corrupted bootloader on an existing "
"board."
msgstr ""
"本页面介绍如何通过 DFU 向基于 STM32 的飞控板（如 "
"Pixhawk1）加载新的引导加载程序。如果您正在调试新板或现有板的引导加载程序已损坏，此方法非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:13
#: a65826c22e9a4561affb8a06e6526149
msgid "What is DFU"
msgstr "什么是 DFU"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:15
#: 7b94c78744ac4f47afb199ba32582fad
msgid ""
"DFU is the \"Direct Firmware Update\" mode for some microcontrollers, most "
"notably the STM32Fx series. It allows you to load a firmware (including a "
"bootloader) over USB using widely available DFU utilities."
msgstr ""
"DFU 是某些微控制器（尤其是 STM32Fx 系列）的「直接固件更新」模式。它允许您使用广泛可用的 DFU 工具通过 USB "
"加载固件（包括引导加载程序）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:21
#: 94be3e3828c1426f8ec354aded5d04bf
msgid "Accessing DFU Mode"
msgstr "进入 DFU 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:23
#: 8031c6bc41ad41d3a5c12389c33984d5
msgid ""
"On many autopilots there is a separate \"boot\" button provided which will "
"place the autopilot into DFU mode if powered while it is pressed."
msgstr "许多飞控上设有独立的「boot」按钮，在按住该按钮的同时上电，飞控将进入 DFU 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:26
#: 236bef425f0e4dab846476602a03b7d0
msgid ""
"On many higher end autopilots no readily accessible button is provided and "
"the autopilot must opened and a pad or cpu pin accessed."
msgstr "许多高端飞控没有易于访问的按钮，需要拆开飞控并接触焊盘或 CPU 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:29
#: 7c9311f11f874331a016ed861d2f86de
msgid ""
"On these autopilots DFU mode is entered by pulling the \"boot0\" pin high on"
" the processor when it is powered on. On a Pixhawk1 this is done by pulling "
"the \"FMU-BOOT\" pad on the top surface of the Pixhawk1 high. The FMU-BOOT "
"pad is located between the buzzer and DSM/Spkt connectors on the Pixhawk1. "
"On a 3DR Pixhawk FMU-BOOT is located between the switch and Telem2. You "
"should pull it up to 3.3V, but in a pinch it does work to pull it up to 5V "
"if you don't have 3.3V handy. The 3.3V supply on the switch is suitable for "
"this."
msgstr ""
"在这些自动驾驶仪上，DFU 模式通过在处理器上电时将「boot0」引脚拉高来进入。在 Pixhawk1 上，这通过将 Pixhawk1 顶面的「FMU-"
"BOOT」焊盘拉高来实现。FMU-BOOT 焊盘位于 Pixhawk1 上蜂鸣器和 DSM/Spkt 接口之间。在 3DR Pixhawk 上，FMU-"
"BOOT 位于开关和 Telem2 之间。应将其拉高至 3.3V，但在紧急情况下，若没有 3.3V，拉高至 5V 也可以工作。开关上的 3.3V "
"电源适合用于此目的。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:37
#: 33ec80a3aa8a401fbe379b17df418bb8
msgid ""
"When the pin is pulled up apply power to the board (eg. plug in the USB "
"connector) and the board should boot into DFU mode."
msgstr "当引脚被拉高后，为板子供电（例如插入 USB 接口），板子应进入 DFU 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:41
#: 2a66054b59b047f68d2861aea816465c
msgid "STM32Cube Programmer"
msgstr "STM32Cube Programmer"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:43
#: e24d0406daea443bac24afcb5123c5a6
msgid ""
"This utility is available for Windows, MACOS, and Linux and provides a "
"simple GUI programmer. It is available at https://www.st.com/en/development-"
"tools/stm32cubeprog.html ."
msgstr ""
"此工具适用于 Windows、MACOS 和 Linux，提供简单的图形界面编程器。可从 "
"https://www.st.com/en/development-tools/stm32cubeprog.html 获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:45
#: 53cf59cba21d4ba185ab163ba8b9ff56
msgid ""
"You can download the appropriate bootloader from `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders>`__ and install it "
"beginning at address 0x08000000."
msgstr ""
"您可以从 `这里 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders>`__ "
"下载相应的引导程序，并从地址 0x08000000 开始安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:48
#: 51cba61349d440539ef142ac64cf3aed
msgid "dfu-util tool"
msgstr "dfu-util 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:50
#: bf988ef27ccd44f0af7621c38d825f14
msgid ""
"This is a command line DFU programming tool. On Linux machines with apt you "
"can install it using:"
msgstr "这是一个命令行 DFU 编程工具。在带有 apt 的 Linux 系统上，可使用以下命令安装："

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:53
#: fdc624a2409d43419bac412bce89f6ae
msgid "sudo apt-get install dfu-util"
msgstr "sudo apt-get install dfu-util"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:55
#: 8dcfb547df0c43a289341b961fe2eeb6
msgid ""
"On other systems please see `http://dfu-util.sourceforge.net/ <http://dfu-"
"util.sourceforge.net/>`__."
msgstr ""
"在其他系统上，请参阅 `http://dfu-util.sourceforge.net/ <http://dfu-"
"util.sourceforge.net/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:58
#: eb752b378aee4d06ace7eb2b466087ae
msgid "Listing DFU Devices"
msgstr "列出 DFU 设备"

