msgstr "运行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:66
#: fa574e1940b645e1928e84dba78edce3
msgid "You should get a result like this:"
msgstr "您应该得到如下结果："

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:83
#: 961d61b6e5e44dbfa314f314cd0e3137
msgid ""
"If you don't get that then do some googling on how to debug USB connection "
"issues with DFU."
msgstr "如果没有得到该结果，请通过搜索引擎查找如何调试 DFU 的 USB 连接问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:86
#: 668fae491a3c41d7a3cbf02b833ce131
msgid "Loading a bootloader"
msgstr "加载引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:88
#: 177bcb5a8043472e8eb1c0d8ee46caa9
msgid "The current bootloaders suitable for ArduPilot on STM32 are here:"
msgstr "适用于 STM32 上 ArduPilot 的当前引导程序位于此处："

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:90
#: abeee78e6d994c3e8c60e4130fc38019
msgid ""
"`https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders>`__"
msgstr ""
"`https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:92
#: 5a212c002a4f42b0a0200535735d65a1
msgid "download the px4fmuv2_bl.bin and run this:"
msgstr "下载 px4fmuv2_bl.bin 并运行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:98
#: aca4cb34f9a44f7ea9dfe99b9b2e601b
msgid ""
"it should say \"Downloading\" and show a progress bar. On completion the "
"board is ready to test the bootloader."
msgstr "应显示「Downloading」并显示进度条。完成后，板子即可测试引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:100
#: 06968798ea4648e69bb0e67e171887aa
msgid ""
"After you have the bootloader loaded power cycle with the boot0 pin pulled "
"down (note that it is already pulled down by a resistor on a Pixhawk1, so "
"just power cycle)."
msgstr ""
"加载完引导程序后，在 boot0 引脚被拉低的情况下重新上电（注意，在 Pixhawk1 上，该引脚已通过电阻被拉低，因此只需重新上电即可）。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-DFU-to-load-bootloader.rst:104
#: 43f872a668b4433d9f44008d56c06772
msgid ""
"Then check your USB bus and you should see a device \"PX4 BL FMU v2.x\" with"
" vendorID 0x26ac and productID 0x0011. You can now use the normal firmware "
"load tools from ArduPilot to load a flight firmware."
msgstr ""
"然后检查您的 USB 总线，应看到一个名为「PX4 BL FMU v2.x」的设备，厂商 ID 为 0x26ac，产品 ID 为 "
"0x0011。现在您可以使用 ArduPilot 的正常固件加载工具来加载飞行固件。"
